        "SOI: financials (POC: 54,590 rows)",
        "990 XML: mission + program text, the only embedding source (POC: 50,971 filings)",
        "Census + ARC: ZIP → county → Appalachia (34,236 ZIPs)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Quality + cost",
      "items": [
        "Search eval: 91% relevant (50 questions)",
        "Buddy eval: 1 unsupported claim of 401",
        "Supabase Pro $25/mo; Vercel + GitHub Actions free",
